  "user_direction": "Develop the fuller perfume now at the existing 30 mL scale, without a seven-material cap or mandatory 10 mL trial. Gin and vetiver central, cypress light. Latest correction explicitly permits Hedione, excludes jasmine accords, and selects citrus character for the middle.",
  "batch_size_authority": "EXISTING_30ML_SCALE_RETAINED_IN_RESPONSE_TO_USER_REJECTION_OF_MANDATORY_10ML_TRIAL",
  "target_ideal": "Dry gin and bitter peel, developing into a citrus-leaf middle with transparent support, then recognizable Indian vetiver framed by smooth wood and restrained cedar. Cypress and one musk remain accents.",
  "current_inventory_build": "Ten exact current neat/as-supplied fragrance stocks. Add Iso E Super, Cedarwood Virginia and Petitgrain EO Paraguay; retain Hedione under the user's explicit correction. No jasmine accord. Remaining physical quantities and lot condition are not measured.",
  "design_review": {
    "change_classification": "BOUNDED_FULLER_CITRUS_MIDDLE_SUCCESSOR",
    "user_authorization": "User requested immediate further development, rejected the mandatory small trial and seven-material constraint, explicitly permitted Hedione and excluded jasmine accords, then proposed citrus character in the middle.",
    "independent_review": "Native Sol botanical-heart review and Astra Max woody-body review both supported Hedione plus a Petitgrain-led citrus-leaf middle with Iso E Super, Indian vetiver and restrained Virginia cedar; Clary Sage omitted under the latest preference.",
    "parent_selection": "One ten-material formulation. Hedione supplies transparent support, Iso E Super woody fullness, Petitgrain the citrus-leaf middle, and a small Virginia cedar allocation gives wood texture. No fixed ingredient count or score-driven additions.",
    "dose_rationale": "New parent-selected formulation hypothesis, not derived from supplier use-level maxima or optimized/physically measured potency. Raw fragrance subtotal and carrier remain constant. Some Hedione, vetiver, grapefruit and coriander allocation is redistributed to the three additions; juniper, cypress and Zenolide remain unchanged.",
    "physical_or_safety_authority_delegated": false
  },
